  "body": "[navigate to a fragment](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#navigate-fragid) algorithm does not update document's url at all although it is expected to happen before [step 13 when popstate event is fired](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#update-document-for-history-step-application).\r\n\r\nI see that it might be updated during step 4 when navigation event is fired but [inner navigate event firing algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#inner-navigate-event-firing-algorithm) will execute [URL and history update steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#url-and-history-update-steps) only If event's [interception state](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#concept-navigateevent-interception-state) is not \"none\".\r\n\r\n",
